
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Simulator
    participant D as Simulated Device
    participant C as Controller

    S->>D: Initialize device
    D->>D: Wait random startup delay
    D->>C: POST /devices/{id}/inform (BOOT)
    C->>C: Register or update device
    C-->>D: 200 OK, empty commands

    loop Periodically
        D->>C: Inform (PERIODIC)
        C->>C: Refresh device record
        C-->>D: 200 OK, empty commands
    end

